!
! Chemistry file for the manuscript: "Experimental and modeling study of styrene oxidation in spherical reactor and shock tube", Andrea Comandini, Gaelle Pengloan, Said Abid, Nabiha Chaumeix
! Submitted to Combustion and Flame
!

!The model is based on the aromatic chemistry for toluene by
!W. K. Metcalfe, S.Dooley, F. L. Dryer, 

!Notes on using the mechanism:
!	1)	Search for 'main bath' to comment out the appropriate expression
!		for h+o2(+m) = ho2(+m) - from Metcalfe et al.
!       2)      Some pressure dependent reactions must be commented/uncommented
!               depending on pressure under investigation. Search for "pressure" - from Metcalfe et al.
!       3)      Search for 'plug flow reactor' to comment the appropriate expression 
!               for the h-addition reaction to the vinyl mojety of styrene

